  --target-db-cluster-identifier: string # Identifier of the secondary Aurora DB cluster that you want to promote to primary for the Aurora global database (<a>GlobalCluster</a>.) Use the Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the identifier so that Aurora can locate the cluster in its Amazon Web Services Region.
