  --seconds-before-timeout: int # <p>The amount of time, in seconds, that Aurora Serverless v1 tries to find a scaling point to perform seamless scaling before enforcing the timeout action. The default is 300.</p> <p>Specify a value between 10 and 600 seconds.</p>
